{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c192545d73216a12","name":"The Kashyyyk Resistance","source":{"id":"source:reference-c192545d73216a12","title":"The Kashyyyk Resistance","revision":21204,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:21:02Z","sha256":"67b6d7a6a2c75a824b0675994825ba1cb505a2feecbb2e1b5baf18adc3a6d36e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21204","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Kashyyyk%20Resistance&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c192545d73216a12","blocks":[{"tag":"h4","children":["Description"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Kashyyyk Resistance is a formal name given to the informal organization responsible for fighting against the oppression of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"},". The Kashyyyk Resistance truly forms around the time of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", at first as a group of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," fighting off the Separatists, and then later as a rebellion against ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}," and its practice of using ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," as slaves. Once the Empire has risen to its peak, The Kashyyyk Resistance engages in a desperate struggle not only to survive but also to free their people from oppression.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Kashyyyk Resistance has no formal organization, although it does have leaders and small groups that could be described as cells. The Resistance forms when a small group of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," finally decides to stand up to their oppressors. Although sometimes these small groups join together to form a larger force, this can be dangerous, as their Imperial masters are ruthless in crushing opposition and zealous in searching out any organized resistance movement. For this reason, The Kashyyyk Resistance can only communicate sporadically, and many members of the resistance don't know that there are others on their world resisting the Empire. On rare occasions, multiple groups of freedom fighters will come together to strike a blow at the Empire, but the Empire's response is usually swift and devastating.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Kashyyyk Resistance is mostly made up of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," that have thrown off the bonds of slavery and have gone into hiding within the jungles of their world. However, some off-world help occasionally makes its way to the Resistance, although the Wookiees are reluctant to trust outsiders for fear that their help may actually be an Imperial trap. On rare occasions, members of other insurgent organizations (such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},") will come to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"}," specifically to aid the Wookiees' cause, and in those cases the Empire finds itself facing an enemy with the resources of a larger organization but with the ferocity and local knowledge possessed by their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," slaves.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Goals"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Kashyyyk Resistance has one overarching goal, shared by all of its disparate members: free the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," from the oppression of slavery, and cast ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}," out of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"},". In the short term, their goals focus on increasing the number of freed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," (by raiding small slave transports) and finding ways to smuggle those that have been freed off-world. The Kashyyyk Resistance aims to sabotage further Imperial efforts on the planet and to ensure that as many ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," as possible reach the safety of other planets.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Methods"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Kashyyyk Resistance fighters use the dense jungles of their world to move undetected, then climb up the towering trees to strike at targets. This tactic sometimes allows them to free ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," slaves before blending back into the dense foliage. In the event that Imperial forces pursue, the Empire's casualty rate is high.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," are renowned for their great strength, the freedom fighters also defeat targets with traditional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bowcasters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bowcasters"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade Launchers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade_Launchers"},", and Recon Droids. These ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", which are used to scout nearby areas, are linked through ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlinks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlinks"}," for remote control. Their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Explosive Charges"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Explosive_Charges"}," are capable of dispatching hidden opponents.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["During the second Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"},", Wookiees use retrofitted ",{"tag":"a","children":["Oevvaor Jet Catamarans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Oevvaor_Jet_Catamarans?action=edit&redlink=1"}," in an attempt to fend off Imperial landers and gunships. Some local traders and merchants help evacuate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," families or engage Imperial slave transports.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Notable Members"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although most members of The Kashyyyk Resistance are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"},", a few key offworlders come to their aid, including several Jedi, smuggler ",{"tag":"a","children":["Han Solo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Han_Solo","referenceId":"reference:a89025e6f64f390b"},", and slicer ",{"tag":"a","children":["Filii Bitters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Filii_Bitters?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Chewbacca"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chewbacca","referenceId":"reference:be3103c4d1375315"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Chewbacca"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chewbacca","referenceId":"reference:be3103c4d1375315"},", a Clone Wars veteran, is a well-known and respected ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"},". Chewie, as his ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," friends call him, bonds a life debt to Corellian smuggler ",{"tag":"a","children":["Han Solo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Han_Solo","referenceId":"reference:a89025e6f64f390b"}," for saving him from Imperial slavery. The two become best friends and work to free captive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," and stop ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshan","referenceId":"reference:7462eb9a66c70e5d"}," slavers.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Filli Bitters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Filli_Bitters?action=edit&redlink=1"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Filii Bitters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Filii_Bitters?action=edit&redlink=1"}," is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," scoundrel who has a crush on the Jedi ",{"tag":"a","children":["Olee Starstone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Olee_Starstone?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Bitters serves as slicer on ",{"tag":"a","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Drunk Dancer"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Drunk_Dancer?action=edit&redlink=1"},", a smuggling freighter. He programs a derelict Separatist ship to take out an Imperial cruiser, enabling ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," to flee Imperial forces during the second Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Han Solo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Han_Solo","referenceId":"reference:a89025e6f64f390b"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Corellian smuggler Han Solo helps his best friend, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Chewbacca"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chewbacca","referenceId":"reference:be3103c4d1375315"},", to free ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," from Imperial captivity and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshan","referenceId":"reference:7462eb9a66c70e5d"}," slavers. For Solo, it begins when he is a lieutenant in the Imperial Navy, ordered to assist in slaving and construction work. While on this assignment, he meets an injured ",{"tag":"a","children":["Chewbacca"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chewbacca","referenceId":"reference:be3103c4d1375315"},". During a construction job, a senior officer draws a blaster on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"},", and things escalate quickly. Solo stuns the officer, saves the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"},", and helps him escape. Later, Chewbacca informs Solo that he is losing family and friends to slavery, and the duo head to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"}," to help. During a Life Day Celebration, they save Chewbacca's son ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lumpawarrump"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lumpawarrump?action=edit&redlink=1"}," from Imperials. Solo's most important aid to the resistance includes defeating ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshan","referenceId":"reference:7462eb9a66c70e5d"}," slaver ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pekt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pekt?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and Moff ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hindane Darcc"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hindane_Darcc?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jent Koush"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jent_Koush?action=edit&redlink=1"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Imperial Lieutenant Jent Koush, stationed on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"},", finds himself sympathetic to the Wookiees' plight. Through the alteration of manifest records, he secretly aids ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," escaping Imperial control whenever possible. Allegedly, he also gives aid to smugglers, merchants, and others who try to help the resistance. Most often, that aid comes in the form of misdirection or turning a blind eye to certain activities. It is not clear whether Koush has contacts within ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}," or acts of his own accord.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Galen Marek"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galen_Marek","referenceId":"reference:fab99915522f39b3"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Raised on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"},", Galen Marek is the son of Jedi survivors of Order 66. After Vader murders his father, Marek is taken by Vader to become the Sith Lord's secret apprentice under the name \"Starkiller.\" Galen Marek aids the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," as they resist the newly formed Empire, destroying the Empire's gigantic machine used to transport ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," slaves into space. His family's crest later becomes the inspiration for The Rebel Alliance's symbol.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Salporin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Salporin","referenceId":"reference:2c6c12a1933a39e4"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Master of the curved ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ryyk Blades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ryyk_Blades"}," and veteran of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", Salporin is one of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," enslaved by the Empire. A childhood friend of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Chewbacca"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chewbacca","referenceId":"reference:be3103c4d1375315"},", Salporin learns that a group of Rebel Alliance commandos have infiltrated Kashyyyk's jungle and breaks free to find them. His knowledge of the forests and Imperial slave camps, as well as his battle skills, are valuable in helping liberate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"}," from Imperial control.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Using the Kashyyyk Resistance"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Most Kashyyyk Resistance plots revolve around rescuing enslaved ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"},", stopping slavers, or making hit-and-run strikes on Imperial forces, vessels, or structures. While members' plans are usually straightforward, their strategies and their natural strength allow them to persevere during dark times.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Heroes wanting to help The Kashyyyk Resistance will have to be careful how they go about it, since the Empire has officers, troops, and spies trying to put down the freedom fighters or anyone giving aid. Heroes who are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," resistance fighters combat not only Imperials and slavers but also the planet's natural fauna, creating challenging encounters that rely on excellent tactics, team coordination, and some surprises.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}," and others sympathetic to the Rebel cause find the resistance accepting of aid. Most ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," warriors who flee ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"}," following Imperial bombardment are willing to join the Rebellion as freedom fighters. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," are not above accepting assistance from smugglers, mercenaries, or other similarly unsavory types.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshans"}," and members of the Imperial forces are not likely to ally with the resistance. The Trandoshans' history of slavery and brutality is enough to enrage even the calmest ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"},", and the bombardment of their world by Imperial forces not long after the attempted Confederate invasion does not leave the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," sympathetic to the Empire, either.\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Kashyyyk Resistance Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee Berserker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee_Berserker","referenceId":"reference:01172e3c50e0ebf7"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee Warrior"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee_Warrior","referenceId":"reference:7905f19e6a430540"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee Freedom Fighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee_Freedom_Fighter","referenceId":"reference:ea0643d59bf048a5"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 3\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Heroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Chewbacca, Claatuvac Scout"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chewbacca,_Claatuvac_Scout","referenceId":"reference:4dfa03197b258448"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Merumeru"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Merumeru","referenceId":"reference:e5afa855cbb7de5d"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Salporin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Salporin","referenceId":"reference:2c6c12a1933a39e4"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Chewbacca"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chewbacca","referenceId":"reference:be3103c4d1375315"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Han Solo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Han_Solo","referenceId":"reference:a89025e6f64f390b"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 12\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Tarfful"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tarfful","referenceId":"reference:121ae61b564ba4ae"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 12\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Vehicles"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TYPE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["IMAGE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Oevvaor Jet Catamaran"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Oevvaor_Jet_Catamaran","referenceId":"reference:5757cfcc50377d9f"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 3\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Airspeeders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Airspeeders","referenceId":"reference:8831ac17fd67f6fc"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Raddaugh Gnasp Fluttercraft"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Raddaugh_Gnasp_Fluttercraft","referenceId":"reference:23a2626da058e82c"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Airspeeders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Airspeeders","referenceId":"reference:8831ac17fd67f6fc"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"br","children":[]},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
